1
00:01:43,690 --> 00:01:47,680
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:51,110
[Episode 8]

3
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:04,000
Why doesn't Zhen love you?

4
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:06,220
Chen Junnan...

5
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:11,960
Why does Zhen

6
00:02:12,910 --> 00:02:13,870
love Zhou Ke?

7
00:02:14,710 --> 00:02:17,000
Why?

8
00:02:17,390 --> 00:02:20,240
Why?

9
00:02:24,350 --> 00:02:25,980
You've sung for 15 minutes

10
00:02:26,940 --> 00:02:27,850
without saying anything useful.

11
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,240
Why are you here?

12
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,090
Start from the beginning.

13
00:02:31,210 --> 00:02:32,130
Start from the beginning?

14
00:02:34,190 --> 00:02:35,000
When I was...

15
00:02:36,190 --> 00:02:37,190
three years old...

16
00:02:37,190 --> 00:02:37,630
Stop.

17
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,030
-Which beginning?
-Go ahead.

18
00:02:41,030 --> 00:02:42,070
Mr. Gao, here's the thing.

19
00:02:43,140 --> 00:02:43,950
The villagers

20
00:02:43,970 --> 00:02:46,210
all want to invest in Zhen's new movie.

21
00:02:47,290 --> 00:02:48,850
And more importantly,

22
00:02:49,870 --> 00:02:51,980
Zhou Ke likes Zhen.

23
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,400
This...

24
00:02:53,420 --> 00:02:54,420
And...

25
00:02:54,450 --> 00:02:55,520
Alright, stop.

26
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:56,710
Brother-in-law,

27
00:02:56,890 --> 00:02:59,360
if they all support Zhen's movie,

28
00:02:59,390 --> 00:03:00,670
doesn't that mean we gave away
e-bikes for nothing?

29
00:03:01,190 --> 00:03:01,680
What should we do?

30
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:06,240
I'll handle it!

31
00:03:06,990 --> 00:03:08,870
I'll handle it. I've figured it out.

32
00:03:09,190 --> 00:03:10,840
I'll bring them down from the inside.

33
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,400
I'll take care of this.

34
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,280
Deal with Zhou Ke?

35
00:03:13,990 --> 00:03:15,550
I'll get Zhen.

36
00:03:16,950 --> 00:03:19,380
I'll make Zhen fall in love with me.

37
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,360
She'll be obsessed with me.

38
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:26,560
I'm going to take action.

39
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,800
I'll get Zhen.

40
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:31,520
I'll do it.

41
00:03:33,710 --> 00:03:35,520
That way. That way.

42
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:39,910
Can Chen Junnan handle Zhen?

43
00:03:39,930 --> 00:03:41,210
You'd be better than him.

44
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,210
Then I'll deal with this.

45
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,030
Come back.

46
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,430
I'd be better than you.

47
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:45,680
But I can't go.

48
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:48,000
I already have your sister.

49
00:03:49,430 --> 00:03:51,150
Ocean,

50
00:03:51,170 --> 00:03:54,680
I'm going to get Zhen!

51
00:04:00,970 --> 00:04:01,850
Turn left.

52
00:04:02,220 --> 00:04:02,780
Is this left?

53
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,310
Left.

54
00:04:03,780 --> 00:04:04,650
Right...

55
00:04:04,670 --> 00:04:06,320
Our "King of Comedy" meeting

56
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,630
went pretty well today.

57
00:04:09,030 --> 00:04:09,940
It was so lively.

58
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:12,470
So many people came.

59
00:04:13,170 --> 00:04:14,610
Why didn't your boyfriend come?

60
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:17,829
Well...

61
00:04:17,930 --> 00:04:19,649
Many hands make light work.

62
00:04:19,670 --> 00:04:21,820
So, why didn't he come?

63
00:04:21,850 --> 00:04:22,930
I don't have a boyfriend.

64
00:04:25,830 --> 00:04:26,680
When did you break up?

65
00:04:26,830 --> 00:04:27,920
I've never had one.

66
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,040
Why not?

67
00:04:32,350 --> 00:04:33,470
I just want to wait

68
00:04:33,490 --> 00:04:34,610
until my brother finds a girlfriend,

69
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:35,950
then I'll start dating.

70
00:04:37,330 --> 00:04:38,370
You can't afford to wait.

71
00:04:38,950 --> 00:04:40,270
It'll be hard for you to find a boyfriend
with your brother around.

72
00:04:40,750 --> 00:04:41,360
He...

73
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:44,480
Well...

74
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:46,800
What kind of guy do you like?

75
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,600
I'll see if there's
anyone suitable I know

76
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,480
and introduce him to you.

77
00:04:50,690 --> 00:04:53,250
He can't be too muscular

78
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,100
or too skinny.

79
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:54,830
Indeed.

80
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,890
He must be not only lively

81
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:58,830
but also quiet.

82
00:04:59,310 --> 00:05:00,120
He's always like that.

83
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:03,080
He needs to make me want to protect him,

84
00:05:03,470 --> 00:05:04,680
but he also must be able to protect me.

85
00:05:04,750 --> 00:05:05,750
Awesome!

86
00:05:05,750 --> 00:05:06,780
1.88 meters tall.

87
00:05:07,950 --> 00:05:08,430
Let's go to sleep.

88
00:05:09,910 --> 00:05:11,540
I haven't finished, Ximei.

89
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:12,310
Ximei?

90
00:05:16,430 --> 00:05:17,360
What if he's a little shorter?

91
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,070
No way.

92
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:19,560
He must be 1.88 meters tall?

93
00:05:20,510 --> 00:05:21,240
That precise?

94
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:22,670
Not even a little taller or shorter.

95
00:05:22,700 --> 00:05:23,310
Good night.

96
00:05:30,940 --> 00:05:31,570
Great.

97
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,240
Director Zhou,

98
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:35,230
I have a question.

99
00:05:35,450 --> 00:05:37,659
Why did you suddenly change your mind?

100
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:41,750
To be honest,

101
00:05:42,710 --> 00:05:45,350
from the moment
I was rescued from the sea

102
00:05:46,090 --> 00:05:47,620
and given CPR,

103
00:05:48,390 --> 00:05:49,310
I've made up my mind.

104
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:50,870
It was so worth it!

105
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:53,950
So worth it!

106
00:05:55,070 --> 00:05:55,870
It's all destiny.

107
00:05:58,830 --> 00:06:00,720
So many people saw me

108
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:02,750
receiving CPR.

109
00:06:04,510 --> 00:06:05,510
Wasn't it awkward?

110
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:08,430
Ke!

111
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:10,960
Blow hard!

112
00:06:11,070 --> 00:06:12,240
Why would it be awkward?

113
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:13,920
It was a critical moment,

114
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:15,160
a matter of life and death!

115
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:17,030
Who cares whether it was awkward or not?

116
00:06:18,450 --> 00:06:22,450
Zhen wouldn't overthink it, right?

117
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:23,630
Why would she?

118
00:06:24,070 --> 00:06:25,430
No one would.

119
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:27,230
It's fine. She doesn't care.

120
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:32,100
So... Is she single?

121
00:06:36,470 --> 00:06:38,280
She's never had a boyfriend.

122
00:06:40,510 --> 00:06:41,580
Neither have I.

123
00:06:42,750 --> 00:06:43,680
I didn't ask you.

124
00:06:45,980 --> 00:06:48,250
Why hasn't she dated anyone?

125
00:06:50,630 --> 00:06:51,240
Look,

126
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,390
we only have each other.

127
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,310
So, I definitely

128
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:56,190
put her first.

129
00:06:56,190 --> 00:06:56,870
That's right.

130
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,040
So, I want to wait

131
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,310
until she finds her true love,

132
00:06:59,659 --> 00:07:00,900
then I'll think about my own issues.

133
00:07:01,230 --> 00:07:03,520
Aren't you having a thing
with the next village's chief?

134
00:07:03,550 --> 00:07:05,030
That doesn't count. That's...

135
00:07:06,450 --> 00:07:07,540
Well, Mr. Zhou,

136
00:07:07,810 --> 00:07:09,540
you have no idea how deep
our bond is.

137
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,000
In the sugarcane field,

138
00:07:11,230 --> 00:07:12,630
-there were seven or eight big guys...
-Alright.

139
00:07:12,630 --> 00:07:13,480
-And then...
-Enough.

140
00:07:13,980 --> 00:07:14,920
I'm a bit tired today.

141
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,160
Tell me another day.

142
00:07:16,180 --> 00:07:17,740
Have a good rest.

143
00:07:22,790 --> 00:07:25,120
Well, what kind of guy
does your sister like?

144
00:07:27,890 --> 00:07:29,840
Didn't you say you'll only start dating
after she finds a boyfriend?

145
00:07:29,870 --> 00:07:30,750
If she finds her true love,

146
00:07:30,750 --> 00:07:31,770
you'll be able to focus on yourself.

147
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:32,870
Haven't you considered it?

148
00:07:34,810 --> 00:07:36,340
That's right. Why haven't I considered it?

149
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,920
So, I'm asking what her type is.

150
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:38,800
I know a lot of people,

151
00:07:38,820 --> 00:07:40,260
and I can introduce some guys to her.

152
00:07:40,830 --> 00:07:41,560
Let me think.

153
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,310
She likes...

154
00:07:45,080 --> 00:07:45,970
someone 1.88 meters tall.

155
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:49,560
What if he's shorter?

156
00:07:49,630 --> 00:07:50,510
Definitely not.

157
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:52,970
Not even a bit taller.

158
00:07:53,310 --> 00:07:54,360
He has to be 1.88 meters tall.

159
00:07:54,500 --> 00:07:55,330
So precise?

160
00:07:57,450 --> 00:07:58,770
I guess

161
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:01,370
she thinks this number is lucky.

162
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:02,710
Just think about

163
00:08:02,740 --> 00:08:04,740
how she values money, right?

164
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:08,950
That's true.

165
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:14,970
Well,

166
00:08:16,460 --> 00:08:18,390
does this CPR

167
00:08:18,860 --> 00:08:20,940
count as a first kiss?

168
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:25,680
You...

169
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,480
Hey, why are you...

170
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,360
I didn't mean that.

171
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,240
Here, the first kiss was with you.

172
00:08:30,850 --> 00:08:31,540
Sorry.

173
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,150
You...

174
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,150
There's still wind?

175
00:08:46,910 --> 00:08:47,360
A bit more.

176
00:08:48,630 --> 00:08:49,030
Junnan,

177
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,150
is it really necessary to make this room

178
00:08:51,150 --> 00:08:52,550
so windproof?

179
00:08:52,670 --> 00:08:53,750
What do you know?

180
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,710
This is my trick to gain sympathy.

181
00:08:56,870 --> 00:08:58,790
Didn't Zhou drown?

182
00:08:59,110 --> 00:09:00,920
Didn't Zhen give him CPR?

183
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:02,960
I have to win.

184
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:06,080
I'll pretend to have
carbon dioxide poisoning.

185
00:09:06,870 --> 00:09:08,440
Junnan, it's carbon monoxide.

186
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,270
Whatever. It's the same thing.

187
00:09:10,410 --> 00:09:11,290
Okay.

188
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:15,310
Zhen will come and save me, right?

189
00:09:15,790 --> 00:09:17,790
I'm the best kisser in Shapu Village,
and with my kissing skills,

190
00:09:18,630 --> 00:09:19,790
she'll definitely fall in love with me.

191
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:21,720
Junnan, isn't this dangerous?

192
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:23,960
It's fine. The charcoal is damp.

193
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:34,000
What are you waiting for?

194
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,240
Then what should I do?

195
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:38,750
Go down and keep watch.

196
00:09:38,750 --> 00:09:40,270
Don't let anyone up except Zhen.

197
00:09:40,910 --> 00:09:41,320
Don't worry.

198
00:09:46,870 --> 00:09:47,960
I'll stab you!

199
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,670
Keep watch!

200
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:13,900
Mr. Zhou,

201
00:10:14,570 --> 00:10:15,710
help me answer the phone.

202
00:10:21,030 --> 00:10:21,840
It's Chen Junnan.

203
00:10:22,790 --> 00:10:23,310
Should I answer it?

204
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:24,720
Answer it.

205
00:10:27,330 --> 00:10:28,140
Hello, Zhen.

206
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:28,870
What's the matter?

207
00:10:29,510 --> 00:10:30,510
Could you come to my place?

208
00:10:30,510 --> 00:10:30,960
No.

209
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,360
It's about your movie.

210
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:35,690
I want to invest.

211
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:36,320
I don't believe it.

212
00:10:37,470 --> 00:10:38,440
I mean it.

213
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:40,650
I've prepared the money.

214
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:43,020
How about this? Come to my place
in 15 minutes, and we'll talk.

215
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,200
Don't be late.

216
00:10:46,780 --> 00:10:47,570
I'm hanging up.

217
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,200
Chen Junnan wants to invest.

218
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:55,630
He's annoying. I don't want to go.

219
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:56,840
How about you go?

220
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,440
I don't want to see him either.
He's so annoying.

221
00:10:59,790 --> 00:11:01,000
What if he really wants to invest?

222
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,080
Ximei,

223
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:04,030
you go.

224
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:04,790
Where?

225
00:11:04,790 --> 00:11:05,510
Chen Junnan's place.

226
00:11:06,030 --> 00:11:07,120
I'm not going. He's so annoying.

227
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,630
He said he wanted to invest.

228
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,320
Fine.

229
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:54,720
Ms. Lin?

230
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:55,860
-Jiahao.
-Where are you going?

231
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,600
I'm going to Chen Junnan's place
to ask for money.

232
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,150
What's wrong?

233
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:01,450
No need.

234
00:12:20,030 --> 00:12:22,120
I've already got a solution for my plan.

235
00:12:22,510 --> 00:12:23,440
A solution?

236
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:24,670
What solution?

237
00:12:24,670 --> 00:12:26,440
I contacted a newly opened winery,

238
00:12:26,790 --> 00:12:27,960
and they agreed

239
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,600
to let me use the venue for free.

240
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,670
For free?

241
00:12:30,670 --> 00:12:32,000
That's wonderful!

242
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:32,360
And...

243
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:37,510
they have to pay me.

244
00:12:37,790 --> 00:12:40,000
Why do they have to pay you?

245
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:45,390
They launched a new product
and needed to test it.

246
00:12:47,990 --> 00:12:49,300
They were looking for volunteers.

247
00:12:50,790 --> 00:12:51,320
So I...

248
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:53,360
tried it.

249
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,840
Are you crazy?

250
00:12:54,870 --> 00:12:55,390
What's wrong?

251
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:56,240
You...

252
00:12:56,870 --> 00:12:57,510
Don't worry.

253
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:58,670
It doesn't have any...

254
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:00,790
side effects.

255
00:13:00,790 --> 00:13:01,870
No side effects? Look at you!

256
00:13:01,870 --> 00:13:02,960
Yes, there are!

257
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:04,960
Jiahao! Jiahao!

258
00:13:05,750 --> 00:13:06,360
Jiahao!

259
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:06,870
What?

260
00:13:06,890 --> 00:13:07,690
Are you okay?

261
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,510
I'm fine.

262
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:09,440
Are you serious?

263
00:13:10,510 --> 00:13:11,360
Jiahao!

264
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:12,870
Oh no, you're going to mutate.

265
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:13,960
-What's wrong?
-Let's go!

266
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,240
-Why are you pulling me?
-Let's go to the hospital!

267
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:15,630
Let's go!

268
00:13:20,820 --> 00:13:46,050
[It's dangerous. Please do not imitate.]

269
00:13:47,870 --> 00:13:48,870
Don't drip too fast,

270
00:13:49,340 --> 00:13:50,670
or you'll get dizzy.

271
00:13:52,030 --> 00:13:52,840
Jiahao.

272
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:55,670
Are you sure it's a legitimate winery?

273
00:13:55,790 --> 00:13:56,870
Of course.

274
00:13:56,870 --> 00:13:58,320
Otherwise, why would they pay me?

275
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:00,630
Now I suspect
even the wine isn't legitimate.

276
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,120
How's that possible?

277
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,600
I saw their ads

278
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,680
on several power poles.

279
00:14:04,870 --> 00:14:05,790
On power poles?

280
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:12,510
Then why didn't you try
the "Heavy Reward for A Child" ad?

281
00:14:12,910 --> 00:14:14,120
What kind of person do you think I am?

282
00:14:15,790 --> 00:14:16,870
That makes money fast,

283
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,720
but I can't betray Fang Hua.

284
00:14:20,980 --> 00:14:21,550
Fine.

285
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:24,080
Don't you think you're just
grasping at straws out of desperation?

286
00:14:25,750 --> 00:14:28,320
I just wanted to make some contributions

287
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:29,360
to our movie.

288
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,150
What contribution?

289
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:33,150
You earned 500 yuan by trying the wine

290
00:14:33,150 --> 00:14:34,440
and spent 580 yuan on medicine here.

291
00:14:35,030 --> 00:14:36,000
What contribution?

292
00:14:37,340 --> 00:14:38,700
I'll find a way

293
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,510
to pay you back the 80 yuan.

294
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:41,320
Fine.

295
00:14:42,980 --> 00:14:44,860
But don't tell my sister about this.

296
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:46,630
Got it.

297
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,120
How are you feeling?

298
00:14:51,550 --> 00:14:53,150
Jiahao, how many fingers?

299
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,120
One.

300
00:14:55,150 --> 00:14:55,720
What about now?

301
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,360
Ms. Lin,

302
00:14:57,750 --> 00:14:58,790
where were you going just now?

303
00:15:03,970 --> 00:15:05,840
Where was I going just now?

304
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:37,570
[It's dangerous. Please do not imitate.]

305
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:11,750
Chen Junnan?

306
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:16,750
Where's Chen Junnan?

307
00:15:16,790 --> 00:15:17,630
He's upstairs.

308
00:15:19,030 --> 00:15:19,840
Are you Zhen?

309
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:21,510
Are you blind?

310
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,750
He said only Zhen could go in.

311
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:25,870
Then I am.

312
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,960
Ximei changed her name?

313
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,030
Chen Junnan?

314
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,030
Chen Junnan?

315
00:15:47,030 --> 00:15:47,910
Chen Junnan!

316
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:50,030
Chen Junnan!

317
00:16:00,090 --> 00:16:00,900
Chen Junnan?

318
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:01,960
Chen Junnan?

319
00:16:08,270 --> 00:16:09,550
Isn't it damp?

320
00:16:09,550 --> 00:16:10,200
How did he really get poisoned?

321
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:11,240
Put him here!

322
00:16:12,130 --> 00:16:13,210
What should we do now?

323
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:13,960
Chen Junnan!

324
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:14,840
Let me look it up.

325
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:16,600
Chen Junnan, wake up!

326
00:16:16,630 --> 00:16:17,870
-CPR will work.
-His eyes are rolling back!

327
00:16:17,910 --> 00:16:18,750
CPR will work!

328
00:16:18,790 --> 00:16:20,120
Forget it. I'll call an ambulance.

329
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:20,910
It's too late!

330
00:17:15,670 --> 00:17:16,510
Junnan.

331
00:17:16,750 --> 00:17:18,680
Stop giggling.
You've been doing this all day.

332
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,510
Is this an aftereffect

333
00:17:23,510 --> 00:17:24,109
of carbon monoxide poisoning?

334
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:25,069
You don't get it.

335
00:17:26,550 --> 00:17:27,349
You know nothing.

336
00:17:27,550 --> 00:17:27,920
I...

337
00:17:29,030 --> 00:17:29,400
Junnan.

338
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:32,000
Sorry, I didn't guard the door well.

339
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,680
She said her name was Zhen,

340
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:34,960
and I thought she changed her name.

341
00:17:35,180 --> 00:17:36,080
-Thank you.
-They looked...

342
00:17:36,270 --> 00:17:37,030
Thank me?

343
00:17:37,050 --> 00:17:37,860
Silly Qiang.

344
00:17:39,110 --> 00:17:40,720
We've been working together
for a long time,

345
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:42,670
and you finally did the right thing once.

346
00:17:43,070 --> 00:17:43,400
I...

347
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:45,510
I didn't do anything.

348
00:17:46,350 --> 00:17:47,270
Look at that.

349
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,860
What? What's there?

350
00:17:56,980 --> 00:17:58,020
That's my first kiss.

351
00:17:58,720 --> 00:18:01,200
No way. Aren't you
the best kisser in Shapu Village?

352
00:18:01,340 --> 00:18:02,140
Theoretically, yes.

353
00:18:02,750 --> 00:18:05,270
The best theoretical kisser
in Shapu Village?

354
00:18:05,310 --> 00:18:06,510
That was my first kiss.

355
00:18:08,540 --> 00:18:09,300
So perfect.

356
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:13,710
Junnan, these aftereffects
are a bit serious.

357
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:14,550
Okay.

358
00:18:16,030 --> 00:18:17,590
Since you asked, I'll answer you.

359
00:18:18,270 --> 00:18:19,350
I-I didn't ask.

360
00:18:20,110 --> 00:18:20,720
I used to think

361
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,790
I was a wild horse

362
00:18:23,550 --> 00:18:24,880
that no one could tame.

363
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:26,960
But today,

364
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:30,120
I've found my master.

365
00:18:35,310 --> 00:18:36,920
Junnan, stop talking about taming horses.

366
00:18:37,030 --> 00:18:38,270
Things are going smoothly for Zhen.

367
00:18:38,270 --> 00:18:39,750
How are we supposed to
explain this to Mr. Gao?

368
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:40,440
It doesn't matter.

369
00:18:41,930 --> 00:18:43,350
You almost died today!

370
00:18:44,030 --> 00:18:44,440
That's right.

371
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:47,590
Only someone who has died once

372
00:18:48,350 --> 00:18:50,000
knows what matters the most.

373
00:18:56,830 --> 00:18:57,960
Everything is looking good for us now.

374
00:18:58,400 --> 00:18:59,590
We have the support of the villagers,

375
00:18:59,590 --> 00:19:00,880
and I've come up with some

376
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:01,720
fragments.

377
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:02,800
Although it's not complete,

378
00:19:02,830 --> 00:19:04,060
I'm starting to see the whole picture.

379
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:05,000
Why?

380
00:19:05,030 --> 00:19:06,640
Because we have two excellent,

381
00:19:06,660 --> 00:19:07,570
talented actors.

382
00:19:07,750 --> 00:19:08,070
Exactly.

383
00:19:08,070 --> 00:19:09,030
They're so versatile.

384
00:19:09,050 --> 00:19:09,880
With Yudan, Shengzai,

385
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:11,400
and my ideas,

386
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:12,680
it'll definitely be
a great work worth watching.

387
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,200
Absolutely.

388
00:19:14,360 --> 00:19:15,160
Well, Mr. Zhou.

389
00:19:15,490 --> 00:19:16,280
I think

390
00:19:16,310 --> 00:19:17,480
now that we have

391
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:19,000
a little more room in the budget,

392
00:19:19,160 --> 00:19:20,110
I think maybe we can

393
00:19:20,110 --> 00:19:21,880
spend 100 or 200 yuan

394
00:19:22,110 --> 00:19:23,750
to hire a more professional screenwriter.

395
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:28,840
100 or 200 yuan would only

396
00:19:29,290 --> 00:19:30,270
pay for a few words.

397
00:19:30,270 --> 00:19:31,510
Is it that expensive?

398
00:19:31,510 --> 00:19:32,400
You don't understand.

399
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:33,860
I can write down what he says.

400
00:19:34,110 --> 00:19:34,960
Don't worry about the screenwriting stuff.

401
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:36,790
I think I should be able to handle it.

402
00:19:37,510 --> 00:19:38,400
The most important thing is

403
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:39,630
we have actors now.

404
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:41,920
With Yudan and Shengzai,

405
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:43,960
we're at least 60% likely
to pull this off.

406
00:19:44,030 --> 00:19:45,400
-Wonderful!
-Don't worry.

407
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:45,690
Yes.

408
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:46,590
When the time comes, we'll let them

409
00:19:46,590 --> 00:19:47,790
improvise a bit.

410
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:49,790
The 60% is here.

411
00:19:49,790 --> 00:19:51,110
We were just talking about you.

412
00:19:51,110 --> 00:19:52,310
Speak of the devil.

413
00:19:52,380 --> 00:19:53,940
They look so good.

414
00:19:53,970 --> 00:19:55,210
We have something to tell you.

415
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:57,790
We're planning to go to the city.

416
00:19:59,870 --> 00:20:00,640
What for?

417
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:01,920
When are you going?

418
00:20:02,020 --> 00:20:03,040
When are you coming back?

419
00:20:03,290 --> 00:20:04,480
No, we're not coming back.

420
00:20:04,510 --> 00:20:06,000
We're going to the city to work.

421
00:20:08,030 --> 00:20:08,830
W-Why?

422
00:20:08,830 --> 00:20:09,960
Why go to work in the city?

423
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:11,830
I want to earn more money.

424
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:13,110
W-Why do you need to earn money now?

425
00:20:13,110 --> 00:20:14,750
You should finish the shooting first.

426
00:20:14,750 --> 00:20:15,400
You'll also get paid for this.

427
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:16,400
I'm pregnant.

428
00:20:19,030 --> 00:20:19,830
Pregnant?

429
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:21,200
What?

430
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:23,200
-I'm going to be a godmother!
-Congratulations!

431
00:20:23,650 --> 00:20:24,610
That's great!

432
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:26,400
Shh, keep your voices down!

433
00:20:27,390 --> 00:20:28,630
Don't shock the baby.

434
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:30,470
It's not that serious.

435
00:20:31,340 --> 00:20:32,420
We're just here

436
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:33,880
to tell you about this.

437
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:36,320
♪ Lost in the crowds, we carry on ♪

438
00:20:35,720 --> 00:20:36,310
Sorry,

439
00:20:36,310 --> 00:20:36,790
Director Zhou,

440
00:20:36,410 --> 00:20:39,830
♪ Someone will stay
with you through day and night ♪

441
00:20:36,790 --> 00:20:39,160
we probably can't keep acting.

442
00:20:39,270 --> 00:20:41,270
Yes. Sorry.

443
00:20:40,620 --> 00:20:43,940
♪ The art of loving and being loved ♪

444
00:20:41,550 --> 00:20:42,310
Ximei.

445
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:45,160
What are you talking about?

446
00:20:44,570 --> 00:20:48,170
♪ I'll give my all
to get it right for you ♪

447
00:20:45,350 --> 00:20:46,720
What could be more important than a child?

448
00:20:46,750 --> 00:20:47,640
Yes, exactly.

449
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:48,750
As long as you live a good life,

450
00:20:48,770 --> 00:20:49,570
nothing else matters.

451
00:20:49,420 --> 00:20:52,660
♪ Who would risk it all for you? ♪

452
00:20:49,750 --> 00:20:50,440
Don't worry about us.

453
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:52,070
I'm here, and Mr. Zhou is here too.

454
00:20:52,070 --> 00:20:53,480
Yes, I'm here.

455
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:56,240
♪ Locking all the sorrow deep inside ♪

456
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:54,110
If you two need anything,

457
00:20:54,110 --> 00:20:55,200
just call us.

458
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:55,720
No need.

459
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:56,480
We can help you.

460
00:20:56,550 --> 00:20:58,270
We're leaving right away.

461
00:20:56,670 --> 00:21:00,400
♪ Like a clown who can become ♪

462
00:20:58,270 --> 00:20:59,680
So, we're here to say goodbye.

463
00:21:00,030 --> 00:21:00,590
We're leaving.

464
00:21:00,920 --> 00:21:01,920
Take care of Yudan.

465
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:05,030
♪ The superhero who makes you smile ♪

466
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:02,960
Don't worry.

467
00:21:02,980 --> 00:21:04,670
Bye-bye.

468
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:06,110
Everyone,

469
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:08,830
we're in a serious situation right now.

470
00:21:09,030 --> 00:21:10,200
We're making a short film,

471
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:12,310
and there must be
a male and female lead, right?

472
00:21:15,510 --> 00:21:16,880
Let's brainstorm now.

473
00:21:17,270 --> 00:21:17,790
Think about it.

474
00:21:18,510 --> 00:21:20,400
Who are the candidates for the male lead?

475
00:21:20,720 --> 00:21:21,310
I'll take notes.

476
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:23,030
Mr. Zhou.

477
00:21:23,550 --> 00:21:25,110
I think it's time for you to step up.

478
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:29,550
Jiahao,

479
00:21:29,790 --> 00:21:30,400
the thing is,

480
00:21:30,670 --> 00:21:31,950
I'm not from the village.

481
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,310
Wasn't the whole point
of making this movie

482
00:21:33,310 --> 00:21:34,830
to use the villagers as the gimmick?

483
00:21:34,830 --> 00:21:36,030
It's meaningless for me to act in it.

484
00:21:36,520 --> 00:21:37,960
Transfer your household registration here.

485
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:40,920
Register it in...

486
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:41,790
Our household.

487
00:21:43,550 --> 00:21:45,640
With what identity?

488
00:21:45,850 --> 00:21:47,370
You can be my adopted son.

489
00:21:48,070 --> 00:21:48,960
That's right.

490
00:21:49,190 --> 00:21:51,920
But it's too late.

491
00:21:52,110 --> 00:21:53,400
The registration will take time,

492
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:54,240
and I'll have to go back to my hometown.

493
00:21:54,240 --> 00:21:54,790
Well,

494
00:21:54,790 --> 00:21:55,510
let's just forget it.

495
00:21:55,510 --> 00:21:56,000
Indeed.

496
00:21:57,060 --> 00:21:57,720
How about this?

497
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:58,880
Let's skip the male lead for now.

498
00:21:59,070 --> 00:22:00,640
Think about candidates
for the female lead.

499
00:22:00,670 --> 00:22:00,950
Okay.

500
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:02,510
Female lead...

501
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:09,270
I have an immature idea.

502
00:22:09,510 --> 00:22:10,070
Know your place.

503
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:12,000
I'm not talking about myself.

504
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:12,830
Then who are you talking about?

505
00:22:13,510 --> 00:22:13,920
Zhen.

506
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,000
Me?

507
00:22:15,640 --> 00:22:16,550
I can't.

508
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:18,310
Why not?

509
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:19,550
You're so pretty.

510
00:22:19,550 --> 00:22:20,720
It'd be a pity if you didn't act.

511
00:22:21,030 --> 00:22:22,270
My sister can do it.

512
00:22:22,550 --> 00:22:23,920
I don't know how to act.

513
00:22:23,940 --> 00:22:25,660
Many actors nowadays
don't know how to act.

514
00:22:26,070 --> 00:22:27,480
Besides, we have Director Zhou.

515
00:22:28,060 --> 00:22:29,500
He's great at training.

516
00:22:29,520 --> 00:22:30,520
Let him teach you.

517
00:22:32,160 --> 00:22:33,310
Right, Director Zhou?

518
00:22:35,590 --> 00:22:36,110
Yes.

519
00:22:36,420 --> 00:22:38,490
I have some achievements in this field.

520
00:22:39,050 --> 00:22:39,940
I'll teach you.

521
00:22:39,970 --> 00:22:41,130
Why don't you teach me?

522
00:22:43,070 --> 00:22:45,030
No, you can also train me.

523
00:22:45,030 --> 00:22:46,590
Then we'll also have a male lead.

524
00:22:46,640 --> 00:22:47,310
Jiahao.

525
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:49,000
I don't think so.

526
00:22:49,030 --> 00:22:50,200
With your aptitude,

527
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:51,550
the only one who could train you

528
00:22:51,550 --> 00:22:53,270
might be that Director Zhou in Hong Kong.

529
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,960
And it'd take at least

530
00:22:55,160 --> 00:22:55,830
30 or 50 years.

531
00:22:56,070 --> 00:22:57,590
Things are different now.

532
00:23:00,400 --> 00:23:01,200
I know

533
00:23:01,480 --> 00:23:03,110
you have some misunderstandings

534
00:23:03,130 --> 00:23:04,080
about my past performances.

535
00:23:04,650 --> 00:23:05,820
But I've reflected on myself.

536
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:08,030
First, I was overacting.

537
00:23:08,360 --> 00:23:10,430
Second, my delivery was too stiff.

538
00:23:10,450 --> 00:23:12,450
Third, my body language was too rigid.

539
00:23:12,790 --> 00:23:14,160
So, I drew lessons from my mistakes

540
00:23:14,590 --> 00:23:15,680
and practiced hard.

541
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:18,750
Have you seen Shapu Village at 4 a.m.?

542
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:19,750
No.

543
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,750
An excerpt from "King of Comedy":

544
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:23,880
I'll support you.

545
00:23:49,880 --> 00:23:50,400
Thank you.

546
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:53,440
Thank you!

547
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:57,880
Thank you!

548
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:02,240
What are you doing?

549
00:24:02,240 --> 00:24:04,000
Want to harass my sister again?

550
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:04,830
Who's looking for your sister?

551
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:07,510
Ms. Lin.

552
00:24:10,510 --> 00:24:11,150
Ms. Lin!

553
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:23,510
I'll talk to him.

554
00:24:23,510 --> 00:24:24,310
I'll be right back.

555
00:24:24,920 --> 00:24:27,160
Well, be careful.

556
00:24:32,350 --> 00:24:33,270
You're looking for me?

557
00:24:38,160 --> 00:24:39,750
Hello, Ms. Lin.

558
00:24:41,450 --> 00:24:42,580
What, is there something wrong
with your brain?

559
00:24:42,910 --> 00:24:44,110
Are you okay?

560
00:24:45,600 --> 00:24:47,030
[Alive]

561
00:24:45,750 --> 00:24:46,630
I'm alive.

562
00:24:48,480 --> 00:24:50,310
Then cherish your life.

563
00:24:50,310 --> 00:24:51,480
Living is not easy.

564
00:24:51,940 --> 00:24:54,770
Thank you, Ms. Lin,
for giving me a second life.

565
00:24:55,010 --> 00:24:58,380
It's nothing.
I was just doing what's right.

566
00:24:59,200 --> 00:25:00,590
Well, you...

567
00:25:01,180 --> 00:25:02,770
If nothing else, I'll go back.

568
00:25:05,920 --> 00:25:07,110
To show my gratitude,

569
00:25:07,210 --> 00:25:08,170
I've prepared some gifts.

570
00:25:08,200 --> 00:25:09,240
Don't be so polite.

571
00:25:09,350 --> 00:25:10,000
I've already brought them.

572
00:25:10,110 --> 00:25:11,480
You really don't have to be so...

573
00:25:16,930 --> 00:25:17,400
Oh my god.

574
00:25:22,090 --> 00:25:23,130
You... this...

575
00:25:23,770 --> 00:25:26,050
Ms. Lin, a peach blossom tree for you.

576
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:27,400
Peach blossoms?

577
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:30,020
They'll bloom in a few days.

578
00:25:31,000 --> 00:25:32,640
I can't carry this,

579
00:25:32,830 --> 00:25:33,960
and I really don't need it.

580
00:25:34,160 --> 00:25:35,400
I'll just go back.

581
00:25:36,310 --> 00:25:36,920
There's more.

582
00:25:37,390 --> 00:25:38,350
A yacht, look.

583
00:25:40,960 --> 00:25:41,350
Over there.

584
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:42,880
What?

585
00:25:42,880 --> 00:25:43,400
It's for you.

586
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:44,590
I...

587
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:46,160
You can go out to sea
when you're free. Look.

588
00:25:46,160 --> 00:25:47,920
Well, I can't do this.

589
00:25:48,180 --> 00:25:48,940
Actually,

590
00:25:48,970 --> 00:25:50,000
you don't have to be so polite.

591
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:50,790
I saved you that day

592
00:25:50,790 --> 00:25:51,790
because I happened to be there.

593
00:25:51,790 --> 00:25:53,640
I would've saved anyone.

594
00:25:54,120 --> 00:25:55,040
-I don't want...
-And there are snacks.

595
00:25:55,070 --> 00:25:55,300
You...

596
00:25:56,590 --> 00:25:57,110
Okay.

597
00:26:01,750 --> 00:26:03,440
I didn't know what you like,

598
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:05,760
so I bought everything.

599
00:26:06,480 --> 00:26:07,270
Just a small token of my gratitude.

600
00:26:09,440 --> 00:26:10,400
Thank you.

601
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:12,750
It's heavy.

602
00:26:13,400 --> 00:26:14,160
Just let go.

603
00:26:14,590 --> 00:26:15,510
I can hold it.

604
00:26:19,750 --> 00:26:20,270
Thanks.

605
00:26:20,270 --> 00:26:20,720
Ms. Lin.

606
00:26:22,880 --> 00:26:23,960
If you finish them,

607
00:26:24,480 --> 00:26:25,350
call me,

608
00:26:25,590 --> 00:26:26,440
and I'll bring you more.

609
00:26:26,680 --> 00:26:27,070
Okay.

610
00:26:27,590 --> 00:26:28,000
Well...

611
00:26:29,480 --> 00:26:30,440
Can I add you on WeChat?

612
00:26:31,190 --> 00:26:33,320
It'll be more convenient
for you to call me.

613
00:26:38,830 --> 00:26:39,700
Did you scan it?

614
00:26:40,160 --> 00:26:41,030
It's a little reflective.

615
00:26:42,270 --> 00:26:42,720
Alright.

616
00:26:43,240 --> 00:26:43,880
Done?

617
00:26:44,270 --> 00:26:44,990
Done.

618
00:26:46,030 --> 00:26:46,750
I've sent you a request.

619
00:26:48,160 --> 00:26:49,200
I'll head back then.

620
00:26:49,720 --> 00:26:50,480
Thank you.

621
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:00,550
Miss.

622
00:27:06,110 --> 00:27:07,210
-Hello.
-Are you looking for me?

623
00:27:08,190 --> 00:27:09,720
I'll introduce myself.

624
00:27:09,920 --> 00:27:10,880
My name is Li Kui.

625
00:27:10,880 --> 00:27:12,590
I'm the one who sells seadog pills.

626
00:27:12,690 --> 00:27:14,580
Everyone in the village
calls me Ms. Haigou.

627
00:27:15,400 --> 00:27:16,590
Hello, Ms. Haigou.

628
00:27:16,590 --> 00:27:17,350
Hello.

629
00:27:17,530 --> 00:27:18,710
My name is Lin Ximei.

630
00:27:19,030 --> 00:27:20,070
What can I do for you?

631
00:27:20,310 --> 00:27:20,830
Hello!

632
00:27:20,830 --> 00:27:21,440
Hello, miss.

633
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:22,510
Hello.

634
00:27:23,640 --> 00:27:26,270
I heard you're recruiting actors?

635
00:27:26,750 --> 00:27:28,310
Yes, we're planning to.

636
00:27:29,070 --> 00:27:31,370
Can you arrange a role for my son?

637
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:33,590
I don't have the final say on this.

638
00:27:33,590 --> 00:27:34,510
It's up to the director.

639
00:27:34,830 --> 00:27:35,720
I've asked around.

640
00:27:35,740 --> 00:27:37,500
They say you two are very close,

641
00:27:37,950 --> 00:27:38,920
and it's up to you.

642
00:27:38,940 --> 00:27:40,310
Auntie, even if we're close,

643
00:27:40,310 --> 00:27:41,510
I still don't have the final say.

644
00:27:41,510 --> 00:27:43,310
The director decides on the actors.

645
00:27:43,960 --> 00:27:45,110
I'll head back. I have things to do.

646
00:27:45,510 --> 00:27:46,920
Wait, wait!

647
00:27:50,900 --> 00:27:51,860
Here, take this.

648
00:27:53,270 --> 00:27:54,000
What are you doing?

649
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:54,880
Auntie, don't do this!

650
00:27:54,880 --> 00:27:56,510
Take it back. I can't take it!

651
00:27:56,900 --> 00:27:58,470
Just a small gift. Please accept it.

652
00:27:58,720 --> 00:28:01,240
Auntie, are you bribing me?

653
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:03,510
How is this a bribe?

654
00:28:03,510 --> 00:28:05,240
At most, it's buying you off.

655
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:08,270
Well, what's the difference?

656
00:28:08,880 --> 00:28:10,720
Auntie, look, take it.

657
00:28:11,200 --> 00:28:11,880
First of all,

658
00:28:11,880 --> 00:28:13,940
I really can't help much
with the actor thing.

659
00:28:13,960 --> 00:28:15,320
Secondly, I'm not that kind of person.

660
00:28:15,350 --> 00:28:15,830
I'm going back.

661
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:17,510
Wait, wait!

662
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:20,830
I heard you were short on money

663
00:28:20,830 --> 00:28:22,240
for the movie.

664
00:28:23,730 --> 00:28:27,890
Look at this. It's 24K pure gold.

665
00:28:28,400 --> 00:28:30,640
How about this? You can sell it

666
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:31,920
for some money.

667
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:34,310
Consider it my investment, okay?

668
00:28:35,140 --> 00:28:38,320
That means you're joining the crew
with funds?

669
00:28:38,440 --> 00:28:40,680
It happens in this industry.

670
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:42,550
Alright then.

671
00:28:45,070 --> 00:28:45,640
Okay.

672
00:28:46,820 --> 00:28:48,800
You can go back and wait for news.

673
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:50,070
I'll arrange something for your son.

674
00:28:51,270 --> 00:28:52,420
Thanks. I'll wait for your good news.

675
00:28:52,450 --> 00:28:53,580
Thank you, Auntie.

676
00:28:53,600 --> 00:28:54,960
Okay, goodbye.

677
00:28:55,350 --> 00:28:55,790
Goodbye.

678
00:28:55,790 --> 00:28:56,310
Bye-bye.

679
00:28:58,200 --> 00:28:58,770
-Jiahao.
-Brother.

680
00:28:58,960 --> 00:28:59,680
Don't do this.

681
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:00,590
Okay, I can train you.

682
00:29:01,590 --> 00:29:02,790
I'm really amazing.

683
00:29:02,790 --> 00:29:03,790
So many snacks!

684
00:29:03,790 --> 00:29:04,590
Where did you get them?

685
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:07,110
This is amazing.

686
00:29:07,110 --> 00:29:08,140
Did Chen Junnan give them to you?

687
00:29:08,310 --> 00:29:09,110
Yes.

688
00:29:09,110 --> 00:29:09,880
None of them are expired?

689
00:29:09,910 --> 00:29:11,700
Is he that kind?

690
00:29:12,070 --> 00:29:12,880
It doesn't matter.

691
00:29:13,450 --> 00:29:14,620
And there's another piece of good news.

692
00:29:14,800 --> 00:29:17,160
I found an actor.

693
00:29:18,180 --> 00:29:19,010
Is it Chen Junnan?

694
00:29:19,350 --> 00:29:19,750
No.

695
00:29:19,830 --> 00:29:20,550
Absolutely not.

696
00:29:20,770 --> 00:29:22,870
Mr. Zhou has trained me.

697
00:29:23,750 --> 00:29:24,240
Wait a minute.

698
00:29:24,590 --> 00:29:26,030
It's not Chen Junnan.

699
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:26,950
Thank god.

700
00:29:27,730 --> 00:29:30,530
It's Ma Dajun.

701
00:29:36,510 --> 00:29:37,440
What's wrong?

702
00:29:37,460 --> 00:29:38,950
Who's Ma Dajun?

703
00:29:39,030 --> 00:29:39,910
Why are you so shocked?

704
00:29:42,790 --> 00:29:44,070
He's a bad guy.

705
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:46,160
He looks very fierce.

706
00:29:47,030 --> 00:29:47,830
When I saw him as a kid,

707
00:29:47,830 --> 00:29:49,310
I had nightmares after I went home.

708
00:29:49,550 --> 00:29:51,310
Chen Junnan is a terrible person.

709
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:53,070
How could he let Ma Dajun act?

710
00:29:54,880 --> 00:29:56,350
Wait, what are you talking about?

711
00:29:56,350 --> 00:29:57,160
What happened?

712
00:29:57,480 --> 00:30:00,030
Chen Junnan did give me snacks.

713
00:30:00,080 --> 00:30:01,450
But Ma Dajun

714
00:30:01,470 --> 00:30:02,580
has nothing to do with Chen Junnan.

715
00:30:03,110 --> 00:30:05,310
It's because his mom

716
00:30:06,200 --> 00:30:07,160
just came

717
00:30:07,400 --> 00:30:08,440
and begged me,

718
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:10,550
asking us to arrange

719
00:30:10,550 --> 00:30:12,240
a role for her son.

720
00:30:12,240 --> 00:30:13,880
She didn't say he had to be the lead.

721
00:30:13,900 --> 00:30:15,710
A minor role or an extra is fine.

722
00:30:16,660 --> 00:30:17,860
-That won't work either.
-Absolutely not.

723
00:30:17,890 --> 00:30:20,040
He's not suitable for this film.

724
00:30:20,070 --> 00:30:20,590
He just...

725
00:30:20,590 --> 00:30:22,230
He doesn't match our vibe.

726
00:30:22,260 --> 00:30:24,310
But she was so pitiful,

727
00:30:24,310 --> 00:30:25,240
crying and begging me.

728
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:26,070
Alright,

729
00:30:26,070 --> 00:30:26,720
stop discussing this.

730
00:30:27,440 --> 00:30:28,830
Don't we often face the same situation?

731
00:30:28,830 --> 00:30:29,680
Exactly.

732
00:30:29,920 --> 00:30:30,780
Let's give him a chance

733
00:30:31,070 --> 00:30:31,750
and meet him first.

734
00:30:32,540 --> 00:30:34,670
-Let's meet him first.
-Yes, let's meet him first.

735
00:30:36,680 --> 00:30:37,590
Welcome.

736
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:41,640
This is our director, Zhou Ke.

737
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:43,920
This is Ms. Haigou's son.

738
00:30:44,470 --> 00:30:45,300
Hello, you...

739
00:30:46,240 --> 00:30:47,160
Please turn around.

740
00:30:49,720 --> 00:30:50,240
Turn...

741
00:31:04,880 --> 00:31:07,880
Y-You really aren't afraid of pain, right?

742
00:31:09,360 --> 00:31:11,520
His calluses are quite thick.

743
00:31:13,110 --> 00:31:13,740
Not funny.

744
00:31:17,310 --> 00:31:17,830
Not funny.

745
00:31:21,910 --> 00:31:24,560
Well, please introduce yourself.

746
00:31:24,590 --> 00:31:25,190
That's right.

747
00:31:32,240 --> 00:31:33,400
He's Ma Dajun,

748
00:31:34,030 --> 00:31:36,000
the toughest guy in Shapu Village.

749
00:31:36,450 --> 00:31:37,460
[Toughest Guy in Shapu Village]

750
00:31:39,070 --> 00:31:39,480
Well...

751
00:31:39,480 --> 00:31:40,000
Indeed tough.

752
00:31:41,310 --> 00:31:42,200
So tough.

753
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:44,070
Dajun,

754
00:31:44,240 --> 00:31:46,030
can you act?

755
00:31:51,240 --> 00:31:52,510
What role do you want me to play?

756
00:31:53,070 --> 00:31:55,160
What role do you want to play?

757
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:01,240
You're the director, and you're asking me?

758
00:32:02,240 --> 00:32:03,030
He's angry.

759
00:32:03,030 --> 00:32:04,790
We respect you, right?

760
00:32:04,790 --> 00:32:05,310
Yes.

761
00:32:05,310 --> 00:32:07,240
Let me think about what role you can play.

762
00:32:08,030 --> 00:32:09,720
Can't he speak? His voice...

763
00:32:10,550 --> 00:32:11,720
Don't look at me.

764
00:32:15,030 --> 00:32:16,270
Back then,

765
00:32:16,600 --> 00:32:17,960
he competed with someone
to see who was tougher.

766
00:32:18,310 --> 00:32:20,310
The other guy drank
a bottle of Florida Water,

767
00:32:20,400 --> 00:32:21,850
and he drank a bottle of pesticide,

768
00:32:22,100 --> 00:32:23,820
which ruined his throat.

769
00:32:24,590 --> 00:32:26,920
Later, the other guy was hospitalized

770
00:32:27,000 --> 00:32:27,720
and blamed him.

771
00:32:27,960 --> 00:32:30,110
As a result, he was detained for 15 days.

772
00:32:30,350 --> 00:32:31,270
He's been in jail?

773
00:32:32,110 --> 00:32:34,030
But that was pretty unfair.

774
00:32:35,570 --> 00:32:37,330
If he can't speak, what role can he play?

775
00:32:38,030 --> 00:32:40,440
Give him a role with no lines.

776
00:32:40,440 --> 00:32:41,590
How do we arrange that?

777
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:48,920
Kids,

778
00:32:49,350 --> 00:32:50,880
isn't it impolite to gossip about someone
in front of them?

779
00:32:50,880 --> 00:32:51,550
No, Dajun...

780
00:32:51,550 --> 00:32:52,920
We're not gossiping about you.

781
00:32:52,920 --> 00:32:54,480
Just trying to get to know you better.

782
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:55,240
Yes.

783
00:32:55,270 --> 00:32:56,480
Let's do an audition.

784
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:57,350
Okay.

785
00:32:57,350 --> 00:32:58,350
An audition is good.

786
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:02,590
No audition?

787
00:33:05,750 --> 00:33:06,400
I...

788
00:33:06,830 --> 00:33:07,510
You...

789
00:33:11,070 --> 00:33:13,030
Asking you to audition is an insult?

790
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:14,640
It's an honor for me?

791
00:33:14,770 --> 00:33:16,160
Sorry, I don't deserve this.

792
00:33:16,640 --> 00:33:17,750
No. It's not like that.

793
00:33:17,750 --> 00:33:18,720
I... I'm sorry.

794
00:33:18,720 --> 00:33:19,000
Well,

795
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:20,750
you have great potential

796
00:33:21,310 --> 00:33:22,110
and abilities.

797
00:33:22,110 --> 00:33:22,510
You can...

798
00:33:23,510 --> 00:33:24,470
go home and wait for the notice.

799
00:33:24,680 --> 00:33:26,680
Yes, I think you're amazing!

800
00:33:27,000 --> 00:33:28,110
Although you don't like to talk,

801
00:33:28,110 --> 00:33:31,070
your body language...

802
00:33:31,070 --> 00:33:32,790
is very expressive.

803
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:34,640
You're...

804
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:38,480
Think it through, kids.

805
00:33:38,480 --> 00:33:39,000
Okay.

806
00:33:43,720 --> 00:33:44,190
Dajun...

807
00:33:44,260 --> 00:33:45,640
Dajun, your phone.

808
00:33:52,030 --> 00:33:52,750
I know.

809
00:33:56,400 --> 00:33:57,200
Goodbye, Mr. Tough.

810
00:33:58,960 --> 00:34:00,660
He's got a big ego.

811
00:34:04,920 --> 00:34:05,350
The door...

812
00:34:05,510 --> 00:34:06,480
Is the door broken?

813
00:34:07,350 --> 00:34:08,000
Seems like it.

814
00:34:13,800 --> 00:34:14,880
Seriously?

815
00:34:16,000 --> 00:34:17,360
I told you not to meet him,

816
00:34:17,360 --> 00:34:18,000
but you insisted.

817
00:34:18,120 --> 00:34:20,690
Now you've given up, right?

818
00:34:20,909 --> 00:34:21,670
I've learned my lesson.

819
00:34:23,150 --> 00:34:23,880
Oh, I forgot.

820
00:34:24,280 --> 00:34:26,010
He was locked up for assaulting someone

821
00:34:26,230 --> 00:34:27,260
and only got out recently.

822
00:34:27,920 --> 00:34:29,010
Why didn't you tell us?

823
00:34:29,070 --> 00:34:30,190
You didn't ask.

824
00:34:30,400 --> 00:34:31,760
Then we definitely can't use him.

825
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:32,800
H-Hurry up and tell them...

826
00:34:32,820 --> 00:34:34,139
Don't say that for sure.

827
00:34:34,710 --> 00:34:36,760
What if he can turn over a new leaf?

828
00:34:37,070 --> 00:34:37,400
Right?

829
00:34:37,590 --> 00:34:38,449
That's not the point.

830
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:39,400
The point is he can't act.

831
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:40,280
Just tell them.

832
00:34:40,280 --> 00:34:41,800
Don't do this. It's just...

833
00:34:41,800 --> 00:34:42,190
We can't use him.

834
00:34:42,190 --> 00:34:43,030
Hurry up.

835
00:34:43,190 --> 00:34:46,070
Let's think of another way.

836
00:34:46,320 --> 00:34:47,320
How can we think of another way?

837
00:34:47,320 --> 00:34:48,400
Just tell them.

838
00:34:48,880 --> 00:34:49,550
The thing is, I...

839
00:34:50,230 --> 00:34:51,440
Actually, she...

840
00:34:57,150 --> 00:34:58,280
You took something from her?

841
00:34:58,840 --> 00:35:00,320
Isn't this Ms. Haigou's ring?

842
00:35:00,510 --> 00:35:01,320
How do you know?

843
00:35:01,510 --> 00:35:03,230
The whole village knows
she has a gold ring.

844
00:35:03,230 --> 00:35:04,440
She shows it off everywhere.

845
00:35:05,110 --> 00:35:06,880
How could you take her stuff?

846
00:35:06,880 --> 00:35:09,480
I didn't just take it.

847
00:35:09,710 --> 00:35:11,510
I thought if she gave me the ring,

848
00:35:11,550 --> 00:35:12,840
we could use her son,

849
00:35:12,840 --> 00:35:14,710
and it'd be bringing investment
into the crew.

850
00:35:15,250 --> 00:35:17,250
We've seen this a lot before, right?

851
00:35:17,280 --> 00:35:19,280
Didn't you despise it
when we saw it happen?

852
00:35:19,440 --> 00:35:21,800
Yes, I used to despise it.

853
00:35:22,150 --> 00:35:22,880
But...

854
00:35:23,350 --> 00:35:25,100
We're the people in charge now.

855
00:35:25,360 --> 00:35:28,110
Today, for the first time, I experienced

856
00:35:28,500 --> 00:35:31,910
the pain and joy of
being controlled by capital.

857
00:35:32,110 --> 00:35:33,240
There's no joy at all.

858
00:35:33,420 --> 00:35:34,320
If you can't meet their needs,

859
00:35:34,320 --> 00:35:35,060
give it back now.

860
00:35:36,150 --> 00:35:37,030
Actually, if we sell it...

861
00:35:37,030 --> 00:35:37,760
Give it back!

862
00:35:39,110 --> 00:35:40,030
We just...

863
00:35:42,020 --> 00:35:42,690
How about...

864
00:35:43,030 --> 00:35:43,920
I'll give it back!

865
00:35:47,360 --> 00:35:47,840
Jiahao.

866
00:35:48,840 --> 00:35:49,550
Is it really that bad?

867
00:35:50,860 --> 00:35:52,140
Is my acting of being scared okay?

868
00:36:04,510 --> 00:36:05,920
It took so long to return a ring.

869
00:36:07,900 --> 00:36:09,050
Everyone, quiet down!

870
00:36:09,080 --> 00:36:09,600
Quiet down!

871
00:36:10,110 --> 00:36:11,150
Listen to me!

872
00:36:11,480 --> 00:36:13,670
My gold ring

873
00:36:14,230 --> 00:36:17,590
turned into copper after she wore it.

874
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:19,280
She secretly swapped it!

875
00:36:19,410 --> 00:36:20,860
She's a liar

876
00:36:20,890 --> 00:36:22,210
and a thief!

877
00:36:22,230 --> 00:36:23,360
I'm not a thief!

878
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:24,480
Nor am I a liar!

879
00:36:24,960 --> 00:36:26,510
After you gave it to me,

880
00:36:26,710 --> 00:36:27,840
I only wore it once,

881
00:36:27,840 --> 00:36:29,000
and then I gave it back.

882
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:30,150
You're framing me!

883
00:36:30,150 --> 00:36:31,370
How dare you deny it?

884
00:36:31,390 --> 00:36:33,070
You secretly swapped it!

885
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:34,710
Everyone, look!

886
00:36:34,920 --> 00:36:37,880
Given the color and the weight,

887
00:36:37,880 --> 00:36:39,840
it's definitely copper, right?

888
00:36:40,550 --> 00:36:42,760
It's not the original one! It's not!

889
00:36:43,070 --> 00:36:45,920
Fine! If this is copper,

890
00:36:46,030 --> 00:36:48,030
it means you gave me

891
00:36:48,030 --> 00:36:49,210
a copper ring!

892
00:36:49,360 --> 00:36:50,590
In such a short time,

893
00:36:50,710 --> 00:36:52,900
where could I find an identical one?

894
00:36:52,950 --> 00:36:54,280
This is your ring!

895
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:56,590
My husband

896
00:36:56,710 --> 00:36:58,540
bought this ring for me!

897
00:36:58,560 --> 00:36:59,930
He's dead!

898
00:37:00,210 --> 00:37:00,840
Back when I

899
00:37:00,840 --> 00:37:02,760
married into this village,

900
00:37:02,760 --> 00:37:05,230
my ring was the biggest here!

901
00:37:05,250 --> 00:37:06,390
Isn't that right?

902
00:37:06,670 --> 00:37:08,630
Listen to this.

903
00:37:09,190 --> 00:37:11,830
My husband is dead, okay?

904
00:37:11,920 --> 00:37:12,590
Something's wrong!

905
00:37:12,840 --> 00:37:15,070
Ms. Lin and Ms. Haigou
are arguing with each other

906
00:37:15,230 --> 00:37:16,150
at the village committee entrance.

907
00:37:16,440 --> 00:37:17,400
They're arguing!

908
00:37:18,050 --> 00:37:19,420
My husband is dead!

909
00:37:19,670 --> 00:37:20,400
How could you say

910
00:37:20,420 --> 00:37:22,340
he bought me a fake ring?

911
00:37:22,370 --> 00:37:23,810
I'll kill you!

912
00:37:23,840 --> 00:37:24,840
I'll kill you!

913
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:30,280
I'm innocent!

914
00:37:36,590 --> 00:37:37,630
Hey, move aside!

915
00:37:38,070 --> 00:37:39,230
Move aside! Make way!

916
00:37:39,400 --> 00:37:41,190
Stop! Stop!

917
00:37:41,210 --> 00:37:41,820
Make way!

918
00:37:42,670 --> 00:37:44,360
Stop!

919
00:37:44,450 --> 00:37:48,250
The village chief is back!

920
00:37:48,280 --> 00:37:49,480
Chief! Chief!

921
00:37:50,420 --> 00:37:51,510
You're finally here!

922
00:37:51,510 --> 00:37:54,030
She... You have to help me!

923
00:37:54,050 --> 00:37:54,690
Okay, okay.

924
00:37:55,050 --> 00:37:56,300
Stop pulling me.

925
00:37:56,330 --> 00:37:58,250
Don't act like we're having a thing.

926
00:37:58,270 --> 00:37:59,620
You... Get up first.

927
00:38:00,440 --> 00:38:01,710
What exactly is going on?

928
00:38:03,660 --> 00:38:06,080
They came here

929
00:38:06,540 --> 00:38:07,700
to make a movie, right?

930
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:09,590
Well, my son

931
00:38:09,840 --> 00:38:12,920
isn't very popular in the village, right?

932
00:38:13,190 --> 00:38:14,030
So, I thought

933
00:38:14,510 --> 00:38:16,320
I could let my son act in the movie.

934
00:38:16,760 --> 00:38:19,110
I made up my mind

935
00:38:19,470 --> 00:38:21,320
and I just... gave her

936
00:38:21,710 --> 00:38:22,840
this ring.

937
00:38:23,700 --> 00:38:26,560
She agreed to arrange a role for my son,

938
00:38:27,480 --> 00:38:28,840
but then she regretted it

939
00:38:28,860 --> 00:38:30,300
and wouldn't let him act.

940
00:38:30,330 --> 00:38:32,480
She gave the ring back to me.

941
00:38:32,510 --> 00:38:33,920
Then I took a look.

942
00:38:34,200 --> 00:38:37,520
The one I gave her was 24K pure gold.

943
00:38:37,550 --> 00:38:39,840
Now look, it's copper!

944
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:40,480
Look at this.

945
00:38:41,860 --> 00:38:42,480
It's copper!

946
00:38:42,480 --> 00:38:43,110
Impossible.

947
00:38:44,360 --> 00:38:45,630
I didn't swap it!

948
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:47,550
You gave it to me,

949
00:38:47,570 --> 00:38:49,970
and then I returned it to you
shortly after!

950
00:38:50,320 --> 00:38:52,800
I didn't swap it!

951
00:38:52,800 --> 00:38:54,230
How could we possibly swap the ring?
